            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene Falao wav'itanaga Mose na Aloni, na wav'awi'laga, “Lu'gendo u'lu' nav'ezyaga wu'kenagu'zi. Gu'ku' Mulungu ali' wa lole, ene na v'antu' v'anne kwahu'v'ile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumulombe Gu'ku' Mulungu, ku'nguno ngilimo na nvula yeni'yi' ya mawe zyalenga! Ene nku'muleku'li'la muwu'ke. Ku'du' mwendeleye kwikala henanha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe Mose wasu'v'yaga ati', “Nku'v'a du' mbe nafuma ha ibala na kaya, nku'wu'sya makono na ku'mulomba Gu'ku' Mulungu. Ngilimo na nvula ya mawe viku'leka. Haho u'ku'manya ku'v'a welelo yi'li' yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi manyile ku'v'a ev'e na v'akumba v'ako mukaali' ku'mogoha Gu'ku' Mulungu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
